      "title": "Characters: a new person from chosen traits with Qwen Image 2512",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Characters: a new person from chosen traits with Qwen Image 2512\n\nWrites one prompt from the traits you choose and makes up to 4 images of one new person with Qwen Image 2512 in 50 steps. Built from Comfy's template image_qwen_Image_2512.\n\n## Models\n\n- [qwen_image_2512_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2512_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors): Qwen Image 2512, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2512).\n- [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Qwen2.5-VL 7B text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct).\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors): Qwen Image VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
